flowchart TD
    A[Labeled tabular data] --> B{Task type}
    B -- Regression --> C[Linear / Ridge / Lasso]
    B -- Classification --> D[Logistic, SVM, Naive Bayes]
    B -- Nonlinear + tabular --> E[Trees -> Random Forest -> Gradient Boosting]
    B -- No labels --> F[K-Means, DBSCAN, PCA]
    C --> G[Cross-validation]
    D --> G
    E --> G
    G --> H[Tune hyperparameters]
    H --> I[Evaluate: RMSE / AUC / F1]
    I --> J{Good enough?}
    J -- No --> K[Feature engineering or new model]
    K --> G
    J -- Yes --> L[Interpret: SHAP / coefficients]
